<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African April gold output falls to 39.14 tonnes.</title>
<headline>S.African April gold output falls to 39.14 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output fell in April to 39,143.7 kg from March's 43,766.8, Chamber of Mines figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed figures in kilos (ozs in brackets) -</p>
<p> Apr 1997     Mar 1997     Apr 1996    Jan-Apr 97   Jan-Apr 96</p>
<p>39,143.7     43,766.8     40,583.9    160,225.8    164,646.8</p>
<p>(1.26 mln)   (1.41 mln)   (1.30 mln) (5.15 mln)   (5.29 mln)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
